<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Esqueci minha senha · Águia Negra</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body class="login-body">

<main class="login-screen">
  <form class="login-card" id="esqueci-form" novalidate>
    <div class="nav-crest" style="width:64px; height:64px; font-size:20px; margin:0 auto 14px;">ECAN</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:18px;">Esqueci minha senha</h1>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:4px 0 22px; font-size:13px;">Informe o e-mail da sua conta e enviaremos um link para criar uma nova senha.</p>

    <label class="field">
      <span>E-mail</span>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="voce@email.com" required />
    </label>

    <p id="esqueci-feedback" class="muted" style="font-size:13px;" hidden></p>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top:6px;">Enviar link</button>

    <p class="login-alt">Lembrou a senha? <a href="/login">Entrar</a></p>
    <p class="login-back"><a href="/">← Voltar ao site</a></p>
  </form>
</main>

<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
